        SetEntityFacing 72, 3
        WaitFrames 20
        SetEntityFacing 72, 2
        WaitFrames 18
        SetEntityFacing 72, 3
        WaitFrames 18
        SetEntityFacing 72, 0
        WaitFrames 10
  stock @083ec4d0    ; "Well... What if I said...  I DEFEATED CELL!!!!  SINGLE HANDEDLY!!!!!!"
